.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBlibusb_fill_interrupt_transfer()\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBlibusb_fill_iso_transfer()\fP 
.PP

.SS "int libusb_transfer::num_iso_packets"

.PP
Number of isochronous packets\&. Only used for I/O with isochronous endpoints\&. Must be non-negative\&. 

